"""The messages of ``spark/connect/expressions.proto``, of the drop-in's Rust protobuf runtime.

The runtime (``pyspark.sql.connect.proto._rust``) makes this module when ``pyspark.sql.connect.proto``
is imported, with the names of the module that protoc generates of the proto, and Python imports
that module rather than this file: the file is the source that type checkers find next to the
stub of the module (``expressions_pb2.pyi``, PySpark's).
"""
